        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img style="align: baseline;" title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" />&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE </span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Action required: Employee Workplace Incident Reporting for ${subject_person_hr_profile.user.name}</span></p>
<p>Good day,</p>
<p>This email serves as a notification that a file reported via the &ldquo;OHS Management System&rdquo; may require the attention of the Wellness team.</p>
<p>Please review the file to determine if actions may be required.</p>
<p>The required actions may include support or consult for the following, but is not limited to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Physical or psychological injury</li>
<li>Mental health</li>
<li>Health related advice and resources</li>
</ul>
<p>Click the link below to access the file.</p>
<p>${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_num_url_en}</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><a name="francais"></a><span style="font-family: calibri light; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Action requise : Rapport d'incident sur le lieu de travail des employ&eacute;s pour ${subject_person_hr_profile.user.name}</span></p>
<p>Bonjour,</p>
<p>Ce courriel sert &agrave; vous signaler qu'un dossier (d&eacute;clar&eacute; via le syst&egrave;me de gestion SST) peut n&eacute;cessiter l'attention de l'&eacute;quipe de bien-&ecirc;tre.</p>
<p>Veuillez examiner le dossier pour d&eacute;terminer si des actions sont requises.</p>
<p>Les actions requises peuvent inclure une assistance ou une consultation pour les &eacute;l&eacute;ments suivants, mais sans s'y limiter :</p>
<ul>
<li>Blessure physique ou psychologique</li>
<li>Sant&eacute; mentale</li>
<li>Conseils et ressources li&eacute;s &agrave; la sant&eacute;</li>
</ul>
<p>Cliquez sur le lien ci-dessous pour acc&eacute;der au fichier.</p>
<p>${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_num_url_fq}</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>]]></message_html>
